5,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us approach this selection with wisdom and a spirit of generosity toward the future of our science. I look forward to our deliberation.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to be here! This sounds like a big adventure, and I can't wait to help pick a super cool project. Let's make it the best one ever!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Hello... I'm happy to be here too. I hope we can find a project that... that really works out for the researchers. I'll do my best to help.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Let's get straight to it. We need to make sure we aren't just picking a project that looks good on paper, but one that can actually get finished without some random disaster stopping it.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Takumi. A proposal's ambition is only as valuable as its feasibility. We should ensure that the infrastructure required to support the research is actually available and stable before we commit.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,Wisdom teaches us that the heart of any great endeavor is the people who carry it. I believe we must ensure the human element is secure before we commit our resources.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"That's so true, Servas! People are the most important part! But I also wonder if the money actually goes where it's supposed to. I want to see if the researchers have enough for all their treats—I mean, tools!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree that the people are important. But I'm worried that we might be too optimistic. I think it would be wise to see what actually happened with past projects.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,Exactly. We can't just hope for the best. I want to know where the real bottlenecks are and what's actually causing delays in the field before we waste any more time.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I believe we must look beyond the individual proposals. Since no project runs in isolation, we need to understand the current state of the shared services and facilities that these researchers will inevitably rely upon.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,It is a joy to see such thoughtful perspectives. Let us now decide which records will guide us. I shall look into the staffing rolls for technical posts and minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'll go with the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers, and the national computing agreement and facility day rates! I want to see where the money goes and what's still free!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I will look into the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns. I want to see what actually delivered in the end.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'll take the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the portfolio review of schedule overruns. I'm going to find out exactly what's been breaking and where the time is being wasted.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will examine the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the incident logs on shared instrumentation. I want to determine if the shared infrastructure can actually handle the load of a new project.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a balanced approach. By examining both the human spirit and the structural records, we shall find a path that ensures the grant flourishes. I wish you all clarity in your findings.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm ready! I'll be a little detective and find all the secrets in the ledgers! I can't wait to see what we all discover. See you soon, everyone!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope the records give us a clear answer. I'll do my best to analyze them carefully. I look forward to hearing what everyone else finds.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not interested in ""clarity"" or ""secrets."" I just want the facts. I'll find out where the system is failing so we don't make the same mistakes again. See you in the next round.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. A factual understanding of our current capacity is the only way to ensure a sustainable outcome. I look forward to reviewing the data with you all in the next round.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
